# Project Architecture

## Folder Structure

❌ BAD - flat structure, everything mixed:
src/
  components/
    Avatar.tsx
    AvatarTrigger.tsx
    AuthButton.tsx
    HomeHeader.tsx
  hooks/
    useAuth.ts
    useHome.ts

✅ GOOD - screen-based with tree architecture:
src/
  screens/
    auth/
      components/
        AuthButton/
          AuthButton.tsx
          AuthButtonIcon.tsx
      hooks/
        useAuthFlow/
          useAuthFlow.ts
  shared/
    components/
      Avatar/
        Avatar.tsx
        AvatarTrigger.tsx

## Import Rules

❌ BAD - importing from another screen:
// In screens/home/HomeScreen.tsx
import { AuthButton } from '../auth/components/AuthButton';

✅ GOOD - use shared or duplicate if needed:
// Move to shared/ if used in multiple screens
import { Button } from '@/shared/components/Button';
